  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Pompeiopolis/Sebaste, in Paphlagonia, was founded under Pompeius in 64 B.C. in the valley of the Amnias river. The ancient site, known today as Z\u0131mb\u0131ll\u0131 Tepesi H\u00f6y\u00fc\u011f\u00fc, is located across the river (modern G\u00f6k\u0131rmak) from modern Ta\u015fk\u00f6pr\u00fc in Turkey.",
